msgid "I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506488"
msgid "Hey there! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nDon't just walk up to me so casually!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506904"
msgid "Still…… Tsukumihara may be lax with its dress code,\nbut does her outfit even pass as a uniform…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507436"
msgid "Because I know her better than that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507484"
msgid "Her name is #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507620"
msgid "When she's quiet, she seems like quite the refined lady,\nbut that's ruined by her headstrong and unrestrained personality,\ncoming off as a tomboy when she opens her mouth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507808"
msgid "……no. In my case, should I say it's a blessing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507860"
msgid "I don't know how many times\nher activeness and positivity have helped me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508640"
msgid "\"……hm?\nWhy am I even picking a fight with #[him][her]#?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508704"
msgid "she said, as she tilted her head."
msgstr ""

